   "lines": [
    "Emlen and I",
    "went out shoot-",
    "ing in the",
    "afternoon, but he",
    "never fired of his",
    "gun; I had two",
    "shots, missing a",
    "duck and killing",
    "a partridge. The",
    "leaves are now",
    "beginning to turn",
    "and the woods ^are^",
    "perfectly beautiful.",
    "I have enjoyed this",
    "week very much; the",
    "trip so far has been",
    "a great success."
   ],
